; RC5_EA Strategy Tester inputs — GBPUSDm
;
; STRING INPUTS CARRY NO "||...||N" SUFFIX. Proved by a real tester run: with
; the optimization suffix attached, MT5 passed the WHOLE line as the string
; value, so InpSymbolRoots became "XAUUSD||XAUUSD||XAUUSD||XAUUSD||N", no
; symbol resolved, and OnInit correctly returned INIT_FAILED. Numeric and bool
; inputs parse the suffixed form fine; strings do not.
;
; Execution is enabled HERE ONLY. These files CANNOT arm a live account:
; CanExecuteHere() requires either MQL_TESTER or InpAllowLiveExecution, and
; InpAllowLiveExecution is false below and stays false.
;
; The three EXECUTION DOCTRINE V1 quality gates are carried explicitly so a
; tester run uses the same thresholds the vectors pin.
InpSymbolRoots=GBPUSD
InpHostTF=15||0||0||0||N
InpExecutionEnabled=true||false||0||true||N
InpRiskPercent=0.5||0.5||0.000000||0.500000||N
InpRewardRisk=2.0||2.0||0.000000||2.000000||N
InpMagic=5150001||0||1||5150001||N
InpAllowLiveExecution=false||false||0||true||N
InpSlippagePoints=20||0||1||20||N
InpSetupFile=RC5_fixtures_GBPUSD.csv
InpMaxSpreadToRisk=0.25||0.25||0.000000||0.250000||N
InpMaxMarginFraction=0.20||0.20||0.000000||0.200000||N
InpMaxEntryDistanceSpreads=1.0||1.0||0.000000||1.000000||N
InpMaxSpreadPoints=0||0||0||0||N
InpVerbose=true||false||0||true||N
